@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<section class="about-page" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Find Familiar</p>
    <h1 id="about-title">A lasting home for context.</h1>
    <p>Find Familiar is a personal orchestration platform designed to preserve the knowledge, decisions, and work that should outlive any individual conversation.</p>
    <p>For this first milestone, the dashboard establishes the application identity and confirms that the server is available. Future milestones will add projects, tasks, workers, and memory while preserving this foundation.</p>
</section>
